      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "Yes，这里是举行「骏大祭」的祭神仪式\n「神马驱」的会场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55e9f8049a4c3e3b8dcc3819bab9409ad9b2004915ebc767c44f5ab625316e81",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
